<title>INDIA: India ad hoc t-bills at 86.15 bln rupees on Dec 13.</title>
<headline>India ad hoc t-bills at 86.15 bln rupees on Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The net issue of ad hoc treasury bills on December 13, 1996 was 86.15 billion rupees over the March 31 level, the Reserve Bank of India said on Monday.</p>
<p>The net issue of ad hoc treasury bills as on December 6 was 89.50 billion rupees, it added.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
